IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `je21-nouns`
IMPORT `je21-art15-16-revision-publication`

-- je21-tests-art15-16-revision-publication: tests for Articles 15(8), 15(9) and 16.
-- The expected values were written by hand from the text of Articles 15 and 16 and the endnotes (the Law, and so Part 3, in force on 28 September 2021) before the module was run.

§ `Articles 15 and 16 -- tests`

§§ `Names for the readings`

`L3 default` MEANS `the beginning of 28 September 2021, by Article 3(2)`
`L3 refuse` MEANS `the sources do not state it, so a question that turns on a time of day on 28 September 2021 is refused`

§§ `15(8) The effect of a revision`

#ASSERT `Article 15(8): the changes made by the revision have effect as if effected by an amendment made by other legislation` TRUE
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 15(8): the changes made by the revision have effect as if effected by an amendment made by other legislation` FALSE BECAUSE "Article 15(8) speaks of the changes made by a revision, and the Law does not say what the changes in a draft that has not been certified do"

§§ `15(9) The minutes laid in time`

-- The last permitted day is the caller's; the day itself is within.
#ASSERT `Article 15(9): the minutes were laid in time` (YMD 2023 5 30) (YMD 2023 5 31)
#ASSERT `Article 15(9): the minutes were laid in time` (YMD 2023 5 31) (YMD 2023 5 31)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 15(9): the minutes were laid in time` (YMD 2023 6 1) (YMD 2023 5 31)
#ASSERT `Article 15(9): the minutes were laid in time` (YMD 2023 12 31) (YMD 2024 1 1)
#ASSERT `Article 15(9): the minutes were laid in time` (YMD 2024 1 1) (YMD 2024 1 1)
#ASSERT NOT `Article 15(9): the minutes were laid in time` (YMD 2024 1 2) (YMD 2024 1 1)

§§ `16(1) What must be published`

-- (a) As-enacted legislation made after Part 3 came into force: 27 September 2021 is before, 28 September 2021 is the day, 29 September 2021 after.
#ASSERT NOT `Article 16(1): the Principal Legislative Drafter must ensure that the legislation is published` `as-enacted legislation` (YMD 2021 9 27) `L3 default`
#ASSERT NOT `Article 16(1): the Principal Legislative Drafter must ensure that the legislation is published` `as-enacted legislation` (YMD 2021 9 27) `L3 refuse`
#ASSERT `Article 16(1): the Principal Legislative Drafter must ensure that the legislation is published` `as-enacted legislation` (YMD 2021 9 28) `L3 default`
#ASSERT REFUSED `Article 16(1): the Principal Legislative Drafter must ensure that the legislation is published` `as-enacted legislation` (YMD 2021 9 28) `L3 refuse` BECAUSE "the sources do not say at what time of day on 28 September 2021 Part 3 of the Law came into force, so whether legislation made that day was made after it cannot be answered"
#ASSERT `Article 16(1): the Principal Legislative Drafter must ensure that the legislation is published` `as-enacted legislation` (YMD 2021 9 29) `L3 default`
#ASSERT `Article 16(1): the Principal Legislative Drafter must ensure that the legislation is published` `as-enacted legislation` (YMD 2021 9 29) `L3 refuse`
#ASSERT `Article 16(1): the Principal Legislative Drafter must ensure that the legislation is published` `as-enacted legislation` (YMD 2024 1 11) `L3 default`
-- (b) Consolidated legislation prepared after 1 January 2019: the day itself is not after it.
#ASSERT NOT `Article 16(1): the Principal Legislative Drafter must ensure that the legislation is published` `consolidated legislation` (YMD 2018 12 31) `L3 default`
#ASSERT NOT `Article 16(1): the Principal Legislative Drafter must ensure that the legislation is published` `consolidated legislation` (YMD 2019 1 1) `L3 default`
#ASSERT `Article 16(1): the Principal Legislative Drafter must ensure that the legislation is published` `consolidated legislation` (YMD 2019 1 2) `L3 default`
#ASSERT `Article 16(1): the Principal Legislative Drafter must ensure that the legislation is published` `consolidated legislation` (YMD 2020 6 1) `L3 refuse`
#ASSERT NOT `Article 16(1): the Principal Legislative Drafter must ensure that the legislation is published` `revised legislation` (YMD 2019 1 1) `L3 default`
#ASSERT `Article 16(1): the Principal Legislative Drafter must ensure that the legislation is published` `revised legislation` (YMD 2019 1 2) `L3 default`
#ASSERT `Article 16(1): the Principal Legislative Drafter must ensure that the legislation is published` `revised legislation` (YMD 2024 1 11) `L3 refuse`

§§ `16(2) The day from which publication is due`

-- As-enacted: the day made; the other day is not used.
#ASSERT `Article 16(2): the day from which publication is due as soon as practicable` `as-enacted legislation` (YMD 2022 5 1) (YMD 2022 9 9) EQUALS YMD 2022 5 1
-- Consolidated: the later of the day consolidated and the day the amendments were incorporated.
#ASSERT `Article 16(2): the day from which publication is due as soon as practicable` `consolidated legislation` (YMD 2022 5 1) (YMD 2022 6 1) EQUALS YMD 2022 6 1
#ASSERT `Article 16(2): the day from which publication is due as soon as practicable` `consolidated legislation` (YMD 2022 6 1) (YMD 2022 5 1) EQUALS YMD 2022 6 1
#ASSERT `Article 16(2): the day from which publication is due as soon as practicable` `consolidated legislation` (YMD 2022 6 1) (YMD 2022 6 1) EQUALS YMD 2022 6 1
#ASSERT `Article 16(2): the day from which publication is due as soon as practicable` `revised legislation` (YMD 2022 5 1) (YMD 2022 6 1) EQUALS YMD 2022 6 1
#ASSERT `Article 16(2): the day from which publication is due as soon as practicable` `revised legislation` (YMD 2023 1 3) (YMD 2022 12 31) EQUALS YMD 2023 1 3
